1
00:00:01,000 --> 00:00:03,859
Some jobs are better done by a specialist.

2
00:00:03,859 --> 00:00:08,029
An AI agent is a profile with a narrow job, its own instructions

3
00:00:08,029 --> 00:00:11,424
and its own tools, that another assistant can call.

4
00:00:11,424 --> 00:00:15,832
This video creates an agent, lets an assistant use it, and tours the

5
00:00:15,832 --> 00:00:18,930
site tools that agents and assistants can use.

6
00:00:23,530 --> 00:00:28,053
A tool does one thing, such as search the documents or get the date.

7
00:00:28,053 --> 00:00:30,253
An agent is a whole assistant:

8
00:00:30,253 --> 00:00:34,470
it reads the request, thinks, and uses its own tools to answer.

9
00:00:35,220 --> 00:00:39,723
An assistant calls an agent when the request fits what the agent says it does.

10
00:00:39,723 --> 00:00:43,690
So the description of an agent is the most important thing to write.

11
00:00:44,440 --> 00:00:48,809
An agent can also be offered to other systems over the A2A protocol,

12
00:00:48,809 --> 00:00:50,580
which has its own video.

13
00:00:54,785 --> 00:00:59,236
Open Artificial Intelligence, Profiles, and click Add Profile.

14
00:00:59,236 --> 00:01:03,885
Choose where to start, and enter a Title, such as Research agent.

15
00:01:04,335 --> 00:01:06,314
Set Profile type to Agent.

16
00:01:06,314 --> 00:01:08,415
Now the Description matters.

17
00:01:08,415 --> 00:01:12,866
Other assistants read it to decide when to call this agent, so say

18
00:01:12,866 --> 00:01:14,535
exactly what it does.

19
00:01:14,987 --> 00:01:18,387
Availability is On demand, or Always available.

20
00:01:18,387 --> 00:01:22,556
On demand includes the agent only when the request fits it.

21
00:01:22,556 --> 00:01:27,047
Always available includes it in every request, which costs more.

22
00:01:27,047 --> 00:01:28,137
Click Save.

23
00:01:32,343 --> 00:01:37,047
Open the assistant that should call the agent, and open its Capabilities tab.

24
00:01:37,047 --> 00:01:42,543
The Agents section lists every agent that you can use, including the ones of other systems.

25
00:01:42,995 --> 00:01:44,995
Tick the agent, and save.

26
00:01:44,995 --> 00:01:48,735
From now on, the assistant can hand a request to it.

27
00:01:52,937 --> 00:01:57,553
With the Orchard Core AI Agent feature on, the Tools section of the

28
00:01:57,553 --> 00:02:02,864
same tab lists the actions that an assistant can take on this site, in groups:

29
00:02:02,864 --> 00:02:08,997
content definitions, content, features, recipes, roles, users, the time zones and the date.

30
00:02:09,447 --> 00:02:12,585
Select All in a group ticks every tool of the group.

31
00:02:12,585 --> 00:02:16,641
These tools can change the site, so give them only to assistants that

32
00:02:16,641 --> 00:02:19,237
need them, and to people who may use them.

33
00:02:23,454 --> 00:02:27,342
To try an agent on its own, open its Actions menu in the

34
00:02:27,342 --> 00:02:30,414
list of profiles, and click Invoke Profile.

35
00:02:31,046 --> 00:02:34,113
Ask it something that fits its job, such as:

36
00:02:34,113 --> 00:02:36,996
give me three facts about shipping boxes.

37
00:02:37,470 --> 00:02:38,978
It answers by itself.

38
00:02:38,978 --> 00:02:42,998
When an assistant calls the agent, this is the kind of answer that

39
00:02:42,998 --> 00:02:46,180
the assistant gets back, and uses in its own reply.

40
00:02:50,380 --> 00:02:55,440
Give an agent one narrow job, and say it in the first sentence of the description.

41
00:02:56,190 --> 00:03:00,087
Give it only the tools and knowledge that the job needs.

42
00:03:00,087 --> 00:03:03,920
A smaller agent is faster, cheaper and easier to trust.

43
00:03:04,670 --> 00:03:08,751
Write the description for the assistant that reads it, not for people:

44
00:03:08,751 --> 00:03:11,490
say what the agent does, and what it returns.

45
00:03:13,490 --> 00:03:17,780
Create an agent with a clear description, tick it on the assistants that

46
00:03:17,780 --> 00:03:19,980
need it, and keep its tools small.

47
00:03:19,980 --> 00:03:21,410
Thanks for watching.

